                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8ab4f80-5119-42ec-8a2b-4adece7ec874",
                                "sense_id": "7597945b-756b-3b41-9ac9-4f1b9899c5c9",
                                "text": "an architecturally important work"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd791f8e-17e5-4b15-9a7a-c2cdbc47b1f8",
                                "sense_id": "7597945b-756b-3b41-9ac9-4f1b9899c5c9",
                                "text": "Architecturally the stations of the Tonbridge-Hastings line are of great interest. Wadhurst, Robertsbridge and Stonegate are of simple Italinate^([sic]) style, unspoiled by that necessary evil of a platform awning."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "deb5ed02-d20f-4bff-b96e-11095fb7f232",
                                "sense_id": "7597945b-756b-3b41-9ac9-4f1b9899c5c9",
                                "text": "Our next train is the 0945 Largs service, which we'll take as far as Paisley Gilmour Street - an architecturally magnificent station."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
